  <div class="bhd-page__split-copy">
    <p class="bhd-page__kicker">The development logic</p>
    <h2>From mechanism to formula to application</h2>
    <p>Best Hydrate's public formula is built from glucose plus sodium chloride, potassium chloride, sodium bicarbonate, citric acid and lemon powder. The formula pages explain why those ingredients are present and where the evidence is general physiology rather than product-specific outcome data.</p>
    <p>That distinction matters. A plausible mechanism is a reason to investigate and design carefully, not permission to claim every possible performance or clinical outcome.</p>
