<section class="bhd-page__feature">
  <div>
    <p class="bhd-page__kicker">What makes the direction different</p>
    <h2>We would rather narrow a claim than make the science sound bigger than it is</h2>
    <p>The long-term value of a science-first hydration company depends on credibility. That means correcting old language when needed, clearly labelling research status, using authoritative references for physiological claims, and allowing evidence to determine where the product belongs.</p>
